# 🧠 Memory Trick

```
👑 Single Leader
→ One writer

👑👑👑 Multi Leader
→ Many writers

🌍 Benefit
→ Faster local writes
→ Better write throughput

⚠️ Problems
→ Conflicts
→ Ordering
→ Clock Skew
→ NTP

🛡️ Fixes
→ Sharding
→ Replication Logs
→ LWW (Trade-off)
```

> **🔥 Golden Rule:** **Multi-Leader Replication increases write scalability and reduces global latency, but the price is conflict resolution.** The hardest part is **not writing data**—it's making sure **all leaders eventually agree on the same final state**.